Parts of this repository come from others and keep their own terms:

- quickshell/Launcher.qml: styling adapted from Omarchy's Quickshell menu (https://github.com/omacom/omarchy), MIT, Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson.
- quickshell/themes/*/colors.toml (except jellybeans and rose-pine): palettes from Omarchy
  (https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy), MIT, Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson.
- quickshell/themes/rose-pine/colors.toml: the Rosé Pine palette (https://rosepinetheme.com), MIT.
- quickshell/themed/gtk-*.css: based on the Nautilus Jellybeans Theme
  (https://github.com/haiderking1/nautilus-jellybeans-theme), MIT.
- branding/fonts/KaiseiDecol-Bold.ttf: SIL Open Font License 1.1, see branding/fonts/KaiseiDecol-OFL.txt.
- quickshell/themes/*/backgrounds/: wallpapers by their respective artists; not covered by this license.
- packages/nvidia-open-tkg: based on Arch Linux's nvidia-open package; NVIDIA's sources keep their licenses.
- tools/internal/ui: installer look ported from the Omarchy ISO configurator
  (https://github.com/omacom/omarchy-iso), MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Anton Hvornum.
